        <p class="terms-intro">In consideration for being permitted to enter, attend, use, or participate in the premises, play areas, equipment, programs, parties, events, food-service areas, and activities offered by Little Town Playhouse &ndash; Fairfield LLC, I agree to the following terms for myself and for each minor child in my care.</p>

